Server init.
>> a := Blob haaraa: 4.
a bytes: ( Tarree-wantootaa haaraa ; Bin b00000101 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000001 ; 0).
>> b := Blob haaraa: 4.
b bytes: ( Tarree-wantootaa haaraa ; Bin b00000110 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000000 ; 0).
>> c := a haaraa.
# inherited blob does not get the buffer, so it's useless
# it will pass ctr_accept() but since buffer ptr == null, it will return 0
{ Baʼii barreessi: ( a ^ c ), dhaabi. } qabi: { :e Baʼii barreessi: e, dhaabi. }, fiigi.
a gadi-lakkisi.
b gadi-lakkisi.
